Question – tag questions
1 We use these kinds of questions when we think we know the answer. We think the other person
will agree / not agree with us.
2 When we think the answer is yes, we use a positive sentence and a positive / negative tag.
3 When we think the answer is no, we use a negative sentence and a positive / negative tag.
4 When the main sentence has is, are, was, were we use / don’t use it again in the tag.
5 When the main sentence has a word like can, will, must we use / don’t use it again in the tag.
